WEBVTT

00:00:03.246 --> 00:00:06.940
Open Interaction Center, Management, Campaign Groups.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.568
A group is optional.

00:00:08.568 --> 00:00:13.326
If you want to roll campaigns up in reports, click Add campaign group.

00:00:13.816 --> 00:00:17.916
Enter a Name and an optional Description, then click Save.

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:22.336
The group appears in the list, ready to be picked by campaigns.

